endpoints.response_shape:
An OBJECT (the docs say array): {orders:[...], boosts:[...]}.
- orders[]: {chainId, tokenAddress, type:'tokenProfile'|'communityTakeover'|'tokenAd'|'trendingBarAd', status:'processing'|'cancelled'|'on-hold'|'approved'|'rejected', paymentTimestamp:int Unix MILLISECONDS}
- boosts[]: {chainId, tokenAddress, id:string, amount:int, paymentTimestamp:int ms}
- Unknown or unpaid mint: 200 {"orders":[],"boosts":[]}.
